sequenceDiagram
  participant K as Kid
  participant P as Play page
  participant M as Mascot card
  participant N as Netlify function
  participant R as Upstash Redis
  P->>N: POST api game start
  N->>R: save game with 1h TTL
  N-->>P: 3 rounds with options and correct names
  P->>P: preload 3 mp3s with Audio preload auto
  P->>N: POST api feedback prewarm for each round
  N->>R: get or generate all 4 outcomes per round
  K->>P: taps an animal name
  P->>P: compare to correctName locally and add sticker
  P->>N: POST api game guess in background
  M->>N: POST api feedback with animalId guessId correct
  N->>R: GET audiovisa fb key
  R-->>N: text plus base64 mp3
  N-->>M: JSON payload
  M->>K: plays owl voice and locks Next until ended
